1
00:00:03,202 --> 00:00:06,548
This is Workshop Live Q&A, a question board for

2
00:00:06,548 --> 00:00:09,822
live training sessions, built as a Fabric App.

3
00:00:10,272 --> 00:00:13,889
Every question is a bubble in this column: the more votes

4
00:00:13,889 --> 00:00:17,252
it gets, the bigger it grows and the higher it rises.

5
00:00:18,338 --> 00:00:23,564
Lenses re-paint the same column: Newest floats the freshest questions

6
00:00:23,564 --> 00:00:27,048
up, and Answered swaps them in from the shelf.

7
00:00:27,498 --> 00:00:29,946
Pinned shows what the host docked at the

8
00:00:29,946 --> 00:00:32,088
top and what they parked for later.

9
00:00:35,169 --> 00:00:39,216
The Today panel ranks what needs attention, and one click focuses

10
00:00:39,216 --> 00:00:42,579
the bubble behind it, with the host actions beside it.

11
00:00:43,382 --> 00:00:47,260
The host can view the board as an attendee: hidden questions

12
00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:51,202
and anonymous names disappear, exactly as the room sees them.

13
00:00:53,483 --> 00:00:56,224
Attendees scan the QR code, or type the

14
00:00:56,224 --> 00:00:58,613
code, and land on the same column.

15
00:00:59,063 --> 00:01:02,731
Asking takes one box, and voting is a big button

16
00:01:02,731 --> 00:01:06,933
under the thumb; the bubble inflates as the vote lands.

17
00:01:07,383 --> 00:01:10,517
Each person can have five unanswered questions, and

18
00:01:10,517 --> 00:01:13,343
the limit is checked again just before saving.

19
00:01:14,302 --> 00:01:18,102
The host deck is a moderation queue built for the

20
00:01:18,102 --> 00:01:21,902
keyboard: J and K move, A marks answered, P pins.

21
00:01:22,352 --> 00:01:24,912
When someone else asks, a pill counts the new

22
00:01:24,912 --> 00:01:28,212
questions instead of reshuffling the queue while you read.

23
00:01:28,662 --> 00:01:31,492
Press the question mark for every shortcut.

24
00:01:32,297 --> 00:01:36,947
The big screen fills a projector with the top five in large type,

25
00:01:36,947 --> 00:01:41,167
the join code and a QR code, and re-orders as votes arrive.

26
00:01:41,977 --> 00:01:45,692
Closing the session opens the wrap-up: a snapshot of the

27
00:01:45,692 --> 00:01:48,877
column, then what was answered and what was not.

28
00:01:49,327 --> 00:01:53,747
It copies out as Markdown, with anonymous questions kept anonymous.

29
00:01:54,546 --> 00:01:58,268
Ask, vote, watch it rise: one small Fabric

30
00:01:58,268 --> 00:02:02,345
App keeps a workshop’s questions in one place.
